## Third-Party Licenses

### Wahapedia Data

BattlePad includes game rules, stratagem, and unit data sourced from **Wahapedia** (https://wahapedia.ru/).

Wahapedia is an open-source fan project providing comprehensive Warhammer 40k rules reference. The data is used under Wahapedia's open-source licensing terms.

We gratefully acknowledge the Wahapedia team for their extensive work in making Warhammer 40k rules accessible to the community.

**Wahapedia License**: The rules data from Wahapedia is used under its respective open-source license. Please visit https://wahapedia.ru/ for details.

